WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::MarkIVMale,TEXT("The side sponsons carry guns through the wire, with machine guns covering the infantry at their flanks.\nTwo cannon support assaults on infantry and armour. Heavy plating withstands nearby HE; direct anti-tank fire remains dangerous. Slow turns; a five-gun fit is available before deployment."),TEXT("两侧炮舱越过铁丝网，机枪掩护车旁的步兵。\n双炮支援突击，车体较能承受附近高爆弹，仍须防备反装甲直射。转向缓慢；部署前可换为五机枪配置。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::MarkIVFemale,TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep the approaches around the hull while infantry follows in its wake.\nMark IV machine-gun fit: stronger infantry fire, shorter readiness and heavy protection against nearby HE. Shares one platform slot with the cannon fit."),TEXT("五挺刘易斯机枪扫过车体周围，步兵紧跟履带前进。\nMark IV 的机枪配置。反步兵火力较强、整备较快，车体可承受附近高爆弹；与火炮配置共用车型槽位。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::Whippet,TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns face the fields around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground. Machine guns punish exposed infantry; light protection and no cannon make armoured duels costly."),TEXT("四挺霍奇基斯机枪守住狭小战斗舱四周的射界。\n快速履带坦克，擅长在开阔地扩大突破。可追击暴露步兵，装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::A7V,TEXT("The 57 mm gun faces forward; side gun crews watch the approaches along the tall hull.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire. The thick hull resists nearby shell bursts; rough ground hinders travel. Research allows the Gretchen machine-gun fit."),TEXT("五十七毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住高大车体旁的空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸。崎岖地形妨碍行进，研发后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::BeuteMarkIV,TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault; the heavy hull resists nearby HE. Captured spares shorten readiness; a five-gun fit shares the platform slot."),TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，重型车体抵挡附近高爆弹。缴获备件改善整备，部署前可换为五机枪配置。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::MarkVMale,TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.\nA protected gun tank with improved control and stronger resistance to nearby HE. Two cannon break resistance; readiness is longer than the older Mark IV."),TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。\n操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克，能抵挡较多附近高爆弹。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::MarkIVPioneer,TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for the wire and its damaged running gear.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. The escort is part of that tank's call, using no additional armour slot."),TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，处理铁丝网与损坏的行走机构。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，随该车一同出动。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::BeuteMarkIVFemale,TEXT("German machine-gun crews take their places inside a captured Mark IV.\nFive-gun captured configuration: infantry fire, heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Select it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment."),TEXT("德军机枪组进入缴获的 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n缴获坦克的五机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体抵挡附近高爆弹，整备较快；部署前与火炮配置择一。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::A7VGretchen,TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the box-shaped hull.\nThe rare eight-gun A7V fit combines infantry fire with heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active; it has no cannon."),TEXT("八处机枪位遮护方形车体周围的空地。\nA7V 少见的八机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸，整备较快。同一时间仅能保有一辆 Gretchen，缺少火炮。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::BeutePioneer,TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, with spare track parts close at hand.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. They clear wire and repair running gear without taking another armour slot."),TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧伴随前进，备件装在工具包中。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，可清障和抢修行走机构。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::MarkVStar,TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches, while new side doors and rear gun positions guard the flanks.\nA heavy breakthrough tank with two cannon and four Hotchkiss machine guns. Strong against nearby HE; direct anti-tank fire remains dangerous. Slow turns and a long readiness cycle."),TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，新设侧门与后舱枪位遮护车侧。\n双炮、四挺霍奇基斯机枪的重型突破坦克，较能承受附近炮击；仍须防备反装甲直射。转向较慢，整备时间较长。"))
WF_ARMOUR_VEHICLE(EFrontlineVehicle::Austin1918,TEXT("Two separate Vickers turrets look out over the bonnet and rear deck.\nA fast wheeled armoured car with two machine guns and short readiness. It hunts exposed infantry on firm ground; shell craters, mud and enemy cannon are dangerous."),TEXT("两座独立维克斯机枪塔俯视发动机罩与后甲板。\n双机枪轮式装甲车，行进和整备较快，擅长追击暴露步兵。弹坑、泥泞与反装甲火炮是其弱点。"))
